# Notification Center: panel at the right under the bar (x≈1530..1912 Material, 1544..1912 Glass); read rows from the first shot
look glass
wait 2
setup notify-send -a App -A yes=Yes -A no=No 'Choose' 'one of these'
wait 0.5
shot banner
note hover a button of the banner (top-right, from shot) for 30 s: hover remains
wait 30
shot hover-30s
